#. type: Content of: <para>
#: blfs-en/xincludes/cmake-skip-install-rpath.xml:8
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-DCMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON</parameter>: This switch makes "
"<command>cmake</command> remove hardcoded library search paths (rpath) when "
"installing a binary executable file or a shared library.  This package does "
"not need rpath once it's installed into the standard location, and rpath may"
" sometimes cause unwanted effects or even security issues."
msgstr ""
